description: "A seamless loop high-definition retro pixel-art animation of a surreal, dreamlike scene. A potted plant on a windowsill slowly and impossibly stretches its leaves, which then detach and float away like balloons into a purple-hued twilight sky. The animation has a continuous, smooth feel with vivid, high-contrast colors and tiny sparkles. The atmosphere is playful yet eerie."
transparent: false
aspect: portrait

